              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium" style="background:#F0FDF4; color:#16A34A; padding:0.125rem 0.5rem; border-radius:9999px;">&#10003; Achat v&eacute;rifi&eacute;</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-right">
            <div style="color:#38BDF8; font-size:0.875rem;">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mb-0" style="opacity:0.6;">il y a 1 mois</p>
